  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3HWH60C.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmo-voice\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plasmo Voice</a>\n    <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fpv-addon-soundphysics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>\n    <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-soundphysics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a>\n    <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/plasmoapp/pv-addon-soundphysics/\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>\n    <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fuueEqzwCJJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>\n     <span> | </span>\n    <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/plasmomc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>\n</div>\n<h1>pv-addon-soundphysics</h1>\n<p>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmo-voice\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plasmo Voice</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-soundphysics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Physics Remastered</a> 模組的相容性附加模組。</p>\n<p>安裝此附加模組後，Plasmo Voice 將受 Sound Physics 影響。</p>\n<h2>安裝方式</h2>\n<p>同時支援 Fabric 與 Forge。同一個附加模組檔案可在兩個平台運作。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmo-voice\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plasmo Voice</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sound-physics-remastered\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Physics Remastered</a></li>\n<li>從 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-soundphysics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a> 下載此附加模組</li>\n<li>將其放入 <code>~/mods</code> 資料夾中</li>\n</ol>",
